trator bearer session and optional `search`, `result`, and `page` filters are supplied.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-16.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response page contains `id`, `page`, `pages`, and a `checks` list with contract entry-check fields matching the supplied filters.\",\n     \"when\": \"The administrator sends `GET /api/admin/entry-checks`.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The request is unauthenticated or the bearer token identifies a non-administrator.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-16.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 401 or 403 respectively, and the response error contains the contract-defined `code`, `message`, and `field` values.\",\n     \"when\": \"A client sends `GET /api/admin/entry-checks`.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When an administrator requests `GET /api/admin/entry-checks`, the Folio3 Parking API shall implement the administrator-authorized `getEntranceChecks` operation with documented filters, response schema, and status codes in `contracts/openapi.yaml`.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-16\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-1\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A car detection has a readable plate with active temporary parking authorization for the detected office date.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-17.1\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response reports the detected plate, `verificationResult` `Authorized`, `entryStatus`, and `indicatorCommand` `Green`.\",\n     \"when\": \"The client posts the detection to `/api/entrance/verify`.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The detection is a pedestrian, motorcycle, or other non-car object.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-17.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response has a null `plate`, `indicatorCommand` `None`, and the contract-defined non-car outcome fields.\",\n     \"w